  triage:deferredNote "Routed to fix/bb2-qa1-r1 (fenix, owner, cut from the top of stack #1443, 2026-09-12T20:29:38Z). Reconcile the stale Required Message Sequence / Completion ACK by receiver step in both graph-orchestration/SKILL.md and codex-orchestration/SKILL.md with the task-close-is-terminal model documented elsewhere in the same files." ;
  triage:foundIn triage:BB2 ;
